{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_screenshots_plan3_2_trace_rectangle_inspector_screenshot", "label": "Trace Step Rectangle Inspector Screenshot", "file_type": "image", "source_file": "docs/screenshots/plan3/2-trace-rectangle-inspector.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_screenshots_plan3_2_trace_rectangle_inspector_bill_template_maker", "label": "Bill Template Maker", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/screenshots/plan3/2-trace-rectangle-inspector.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Web app for building reusable bill templates: load or capture a bill photo, trace regions over it (Trace step), classify them with semantic data meanings (Mark data step), test with sample data, then print or share. Top-level actions: Preview, Save, Fill & print, Share, Get a copy."}, {"id": "docs_screenshots_plan3_2_trace_rectangle_inspector_trace_step", "label": "Trace Step (Workflow Step 2)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/screenshots/plan3/2-trace-rectangle-inspector.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Step where the user draws over the bill photo to define template objects; the paper is traced but the photo itself is never exported."}, {"id": "docs_screenshots_plan3_2_trace_rectangle_inspector_workflow_stepper", "label": "Workflow Stepper (Your bill / Trace / Mark data / Test / Save & share)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/screenshots/plan3/2-trace-rectangle-inspector.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_screenshots_plan3_2_trace_rectangle_inspector_bill_photo_reference", "label": "Bill Photo Reference (ACME Trading Co)", "file_type": "image", "source_file": "docs/screenshots/plan3/2-trace-rectangle-inspector.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The uploaded bill photo is shown at 25% opacity as a tracing underlay. It sits at the bottom layer and is left out of every export; it can be removed explicitly (Remove Reference) and hidden via a Show reference toggle. A companion 'Whiten paper on new parts' default controls whether new cut-outs keep the paper colour or render clean white."}, {"id": "docs_screenshots_plan3_2_trace_rectangle_inspector_rectangle_object", "label": "Rectangle 1 (Traced Object)", "file_type": "image", "source_file": "docs/screenshots/plan3/2-trace-rectangle-inspector.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_screenshots_plan3_2_trace_rectangle_inspector_object_inspector", "label": "This Object Inspector", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/screenshots/plan3/2-trace-rectangle-inspector.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Right-hand panel that inspects the currently selected object: Name field, 'What this is' semantic classification, Locked/Visible toggles, plus collapsible sections Size & position, Ink & outline, Line up, When data is longer, and Inside its frame."}, {"id": "docs_screenshots_plan3_2_trace_rectangle_inspector_semantic_chips", "label": "Semantic Region Chips (Header / Title / Item / Total / Footer)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/screenshots/plan3/2-trace-rectangle-inspector.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Traced objects are tagged with the bill meaning they represent (Header, Title, Item, Total, Footer, or a custom label like 'items'); the tag is used when a value fills this object in."}, {"id": "docs_screenshots_plan3_2_trace_rectangle_inspector_layers_panel", "label": "Layers Panel (Bill reference, Rectangle 1)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/screenshots/plan3/2-trace-rectangle-inspector.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Shows stacking order: the Bill reference photo occupies the bottom layer while traced objects (e.g., Rectangle 1) render above it; the selected layer is highlighted."}, {"id": "docs_screenshots_plan3_2_trace_rectangle_inspector_draw_tools", "label": "Draw Tools Toolbar", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/screenshots/plan3/2-trace-rectangle-inspector.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Left rail groups tools by role: Draw (Line, Horizontal/Vertical Rule, Rectangle, Rounded Rect, Ellipse, Polygon, Freehand), Structure (Guide H/V, Table), Content (Text, Image Placeholder, Bill Part, Field), and Tools (Select, Eyedropper) \u2014 tracing shapes, aligning them, and placing data-bearing content."}, {"id": "docs_screenshots_plan3_2_trace_rectangle_inspector_grid_overlay", "label": "Grid Overlay (10 px, Blueprint Style)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/screenshots/plan3/2-trace-rectangle-inspector.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Blueprint-style grid (visible at 10 px, configurable via Grid Settings) covers the page canvas to help align traced objects while the bill photo is faded underneath."}, {"id": "docs_screenshots_plan3_2_trace_rectangle_inspector_whiten_paper_option", "label": "Whiten Paper on New Parts", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/screenshots/plan3/2-trace-rectangle-inspector.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Cut-out pictures can keep the paper's colour or clean it to white. This option sets the default for new 